From: Mark Kim <39310405+mk-imagine@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Apr 2026 20:26:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 044/110] fix(beads): route cross-rig agent bead creation from
 town root (#3520)

Make FindTownRoot prefer the outermost town root so nested/imported rig
layouts resolve correctly. Run routed CreateAgentBead calls from the
town root to prevent double-stacking rig paths in BEADS_DIR.

Adds test coverage for outermost town-root detection and a mock-bd
regression test asserting routed CreateAgentBead executes from town root.

Fixes PR #2972 (gt-u30t)

Co-authored-by: cheedo <steve.yegge@gmail.com>
Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
